# WENGE-0002 / SPEC-0001 A2. A host that renders while stopped must not make Play replay
# the idle time as a burst of ticks. Ten seconds idle, then one 512-sample buffer: only
# the ticks that fit in that buffer may run (512 / 125 samples per tick is 4 ticks), so at
# most one note can start. On 6ef921f this buffer held 256 events (the cap).
seed 1
bpm 120
page.tracks 0 enabled
track 0 step all active 1
render 10 s buffer=512
expect event on absent
play
render 1 buffers buffer=512
expect event on count=0..1
expect event off count=0..1
